Two people committed in the 14 days up to 2026-04-12, which is 2026-03-29 to 2026-04-12. Lines are counted at HEAD with `git blame -w -M`, across 18 files and 1,985 attributed lines.

| Person | Commits in window | Surviving lines (share) |
